  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">カーリットホールディングス㈱</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">当社ファイン製品の事業活動の円滑化、取引関係の維持・強化のため保有しております。受取配当金に加え電子材料関連製品の販売があります。</jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">無</jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
